#import "nelson_help.typ": *

= Gui module

The GUI module provides functions to create and interact with graphical user interface components, dialogs, and application windows.

== Functions

- #nlink(<gui:commandhistory>)[commandhistory]: Command History
- #nlink(<gui:dialog>)[dialog]: Creates a dialog figure window.
- #nlink(<gui:errordlg>)[errordlg]: Creates an error dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:filebrowser>)[filebrowser]: Current Folder Browser
- #nlink(<gui:helpdlg>)[helpdlg]: Creates a help dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:inputdlg>)[inputdlg]: Opens an input dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:inserthtml>)[inserthtml]: Insert html in GUI console.
- #nlink(<gui:listdlg>)[listdlg]: Opens a list selection dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:lookandfeel>)[lookandfeel]: default current application look and feel.
- #nlink(<gui:msgbox>)[msgbox]: Creates a message dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:openvar>)[openvar]: Open variable in the Variable Editor
- #nlink(<gui:qt_verbose>)[qt\_verbose]: show\/hide Qt debug message.
- #nlink(<gui:questdlg>)[questdlg]: Creates a question dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:terminal>)[terminal]: Shell terminal in GUI mode
- #nlink(<gui:uialert>)[uialert]: Displays an alert dialog for a UI figure.
- #nlink(<gui:uiconfirm>)[uiconfirm]: Displays a confirmation dialog for a UI figure.
- #nlink(<gui:uifigure>)[uifigure]: Create a figure for app-style user interfaces.
- #nlink(<gui:uigetdir>)[uigetdir]: Opens a directory selection dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uigetfile>)[uigetfile]: Opens a file selection dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uiopen>)[uiopen]: Loads a file selected from a dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uiprogressdlg>)[uiprogressdlg]: Creates a UI progress dialog.
- #nlink(<gui:uiputfile>)[uiputfile]: Opens a file save dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uisave>)[uisave]: Saves workspace variables to a file selected from a dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uisetcolor>)[uisetcolor]: Opens a color selection dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:uisetfont>)[uisetfont]: Opens a font selection dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:waitbar>)[waitbar]: Creates or updates a wait bar figure.
- #nlink(<gui:warndlg>)[warndlg]: Creates a warning dialog box.
- #nlink(<gui:workspace>)[workspace]: Workspace Browser


